   3. ALL AIRCRAFT ENTERING OR EXITING THE TFR MUST
      REMAIN IN TWO-WAY RADIO COMMUNICATIONS WITH ATC.
   4. NOTHERN CALIFORNIA TRACON, PHONE 916-366-4080
      IS THE FAA COORDINATION FACILITY.
 
2603080900-2611010959
